WEBVTT

00:00:00.820 --> 00:00:03.050
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:06.520
Appear!  The circuit that guides the light!

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:07.950
This is…

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:09.690
An Extra Link.

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:13.790
It's as if his Extra Deck is sealed away.

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:17.240
Spectre can't Link Summon on his next turn.

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:20.230
I've already analyzed your deck.

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:26.310
I concluded that your deck is dangerous 
if you summon a Link Monster.

00:00:26.310 --> 00:00:28.650
You're my enemy, but you're great.

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:35.310
To show you respect, I'll defeat 
you with all my strength.

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:39.290
I activate the Continuous 
Spell, Sunvine Plunder!

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:42.860
What?

00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:44.610
I steal what I don't have.

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:46.590
That's how I do things.

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:51.170
Appear!  The future circuit 
that lights up our path!

00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:52.760
Link Summon!

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:58.360
Appear, Link 1 Sunavalon Dryas!

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:04.410
Spectre has taken back 
the Extra Monster Zone!

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:07.290
Now the outcome is up for grabs.

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:33.290
Our lives aren't forever

00:01:34.090 --> 00:01:40.080
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:47.400
Even if it's not the right direction, 
just keep looking forward

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:53.970
Sharing hope for the future

00:01:53.970 --> 00:02:00.720
tell me  We're searching for 
memories lost in the darkness

00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:07.950
I feel your flame  Your 
impulses pierce the light

00:02:08.090 --> 00:02:14.660
I want to share your pain

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:46.220
Boss, it’s crazy!

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:50.810
Lightning appeared to have the advantage, 
but Spectre turned it around!

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:56.960
Maybe Spectre is the one who'll save us!

00:02:56.960 --> 00:02:59.650
But he’s a Knight of Hanoi.

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:01.390
Yeah...

00:03:01.390 --> 00:03:04.400
You broke my formation.

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:07.370
It seems I underestimated you.

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:09.100
Seems so.

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:17.280
If you’re capable of feeling 
regret, you should feel that now.

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:19.750
Along with your defeat.

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:25.270
My turn!  I draw!

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:33.870
The three cards that Armatos Legio Pilus 
Prior banished last turn are added to my hand!

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:37.760
I've never seen Lightning annoyed.

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:42.200
He lost Judgment Arrows, and 
his Extra Link was destroyed.

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:44.010
He can’t stay calm.

00:03:44.010 --> 00:03:46.680
Spectre and Lightning…

00:03:46.680 --> 00:03:51.950
It's best if they both lose, 
but I can’t get greedy.

00:03:51.950 --> 00:03:53.910
Win, Spectre!

00:03:53.910 --> 00:03:58.660
I activate the spell card, 
Armatos Replacement.

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:03.220
I tribute an Armatos Legio...

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:08.830
...to Special Summon an Armatos Legio from 
my graveyard with equal or fewer Link Markers.

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:12.560
I tribute Link 2 Pilus Prior!

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:18.180
Resurrect, Link 2 Armatos Legio Centurion!

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:22.420
The Field Spell, Armatos 
Colosseum’s effect!

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:26.880
I send a Level 4 or lower Armatos 
Legio in my hand to the graveyard.

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:33.480
I Special Summon other Armatos Legio from my 
graveyard in defense position

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:37.620
next to my Armatos Legio's links.

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:44.970
I send Galea from my hand to the graveyard 
to Special Summon Scutum and Sica.

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:48.550
Appear!  The circuit that guides the light!

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:53.250
The summoning conditions are 
at least two Armatos Legio.

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:56.780
Link Summon!

00:04:56.780 --> 00:05:01.920
Link 3 Armatos Legio Legatus Legionis!

00:05:09.860 --> 00:05:12.330
Legatus Legionis’s effect!

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:16.880
I send a Level 4 or lower Armatos 
Legio on my field to the graveyard...

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:20.300
...to Special Summon an Armatos 
Legio from my graveyard.

00:05:20.300 --> 00:05:23.300
I send Scutum to the graveyard...

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:28.120
...to Special Summon Galea next to Legatus 
Legionis's link in defense position.

00:05:29.020 --> 00:05:31.250
I end my turn.

00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:34.250
Lightning has strengthened his defenses.

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:37.250
Is he gonna do what I think he will?

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:41.180
We don’t know Armatos Legio’s power.

00:05:41.180 --> 00:05:42.990
So we can't make predictions.

00:05:42.990 --> 00:05:46.560
Here I go!  My turn!

00:05:47.330 --> 00:05:48.400
I draw!

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:51.930
I summon Sunseed Twin!

00:05:54.810 --> 00:05:57.540
Sunseed Twin’s effect activates!

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:04.380
When it's summoned, I Special Summon 
a Plant monster from my graveyard!

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:07.260
Resurrect, Genius Loci!

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:14.450
Appear!  The future circuit 
that lights up our path!

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:19.710
The summoning conditions are at least 
two Plants which include a Link Monster!

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:21.430
Link Summon!

00:06:21.430 --> 00:06:24.870
Link 3 Sunavalon Melias!

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:28.130
Melias’s effect activates!

00:06:28.130 --> 00:06:32.450
When it's Link Summoned, I 
Special Summon a Plant from my

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:35.610
graveyard next to its 
link in defense position!

00:06:35.610 --> 00:06:38.620
Resurrect, Genius Loci!

00:06:40.280 --> 00:06:45.390
Appear again!  The future circuit 
that lights up our path!

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:47.300
Link Summon!

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:51.770
A second Link 3 Sunavalon Melias!

00:06:51.770 --> 00:06:54.230
Melias’s effect activates!

00:06:54.230 --> 00:06:57.500
Resurrect, Genius Loci!

00:06:57.500 --> 00:07:01.870
Appear!  The future circuit 
that lights up our path!

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:06.150
The summoning condition is one Plant monster!

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:07.570
Link Summon!

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:11.100
Link 1 Sunvine Thrasher!

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:14.280
Thrasher’s effect activates!

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:20.520
When linked to a Sunavalon, it gains 800 
ATK for every one of its Link Markers!

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:22.340
Melias is Link 3.

00:07:22.340 --> 00:07:26.690
So Thrasher gains 2400 ATK!

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:31.940
Then Judgment Arrows’s effect 
will double Thrasher’s ATK.

00:07:31.940 --> 00:07:33.530
So that’s your plan.

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:36.380
Then I’ll deal with it.

00:07:36.380 --> 00:07:38.680
Legatus Legionis’s effect!

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:43.370
I send Galea to the graveyard 
to Special Summon Scutum.

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:45.860
Now let’s battle!

00:07:46.420 --> 00:07:49.320
Melias’s effect now activates!

00:07:49.870 --> 00:07:54.250
When my battle begins, the 
Thrasher next to its link can

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:58.720
attack for every Sunavalon 
Link Monster on the field.

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:01.970
Meaning it can attack three times!

00:08:03.680 --> 00:08:08.150
Boss!  Three attacks using 6400 ATK is big!

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:09.680
It’s too incredible!

00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:12.370
This will end it... right?

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:14.050
Let's battle!

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:18.350
Thrasher attacks Legatus Legionis!

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:22.110
Centurion’s effect activates!

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:28.590
When an Armatos Legio is attacked, 
that attack is negated!

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:33.320
Then I’ll just attack again!

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:37.270
Thrasher attacks Legatus Legionis again!

00:08:37.270 --> 00:08:42.980
Due to Judgment Arrows’s 
effect, its ATK are doubled!

00:08:43.810 --> 00:08:46.320
6400 ATK.

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:47.970
The difference is 4000!

00:08:47.970 --> 00:08:51.050
If this attack succeeds, Spectre wins!

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:53.290
But Galea’s effect!

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:56.740
When this card is send from 
the field to the graveyard...

00:08:56.740 --> 00:09:03.720
...battle damage from the Armatos Legio Link 
Monster linked to this card becomes 0 that turn.

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:05.710
Then Scutum’s effect!

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:12.450
The Armatos Legio linked to Scutum can’t 
be destroyed in battle once per turn.

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:19.740
Lightning stopped it!

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:22.550
Then my third attack!

00:09:22.550 --> 00:09:24.980
Judgment Arrows’s effect!

00:09:24.980 --> 00:09:28.630
Due to Galea’s effect, I take no damage.

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:31.370
But it's still destroyed.

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:40.950
After all that, about time.

00:09:40.950 --> 00:09:43.000
But this destruction is huge.

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:46.240
And Thrasher’s effect!

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:49.400
When it destroys your monster in battle...

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:53.810
...that monster is Special Summoned 
next to Sunavalon’s link.

00:09:53.810 --> 00:09:57.150
Appear, Legatus Legionis!

00:10:00.140 --> 00:10:04.490
Legatus Legionis attacks Centurion!

00:10:12.970 --> 00:10:15.360
Now the battle is over.

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:18.700
But I still have something left to do.

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:24.280
The Continuous Spell, Sunvine 
Cross Breed’s effect.

00:10:24.280 --> 00:10:31.240
I tribute a Link Monster to Special Summon a 
Plant from my graveyard by negating its effects!

00:10:31.240 --> 00:10:33.750
I tribute Thrasher!

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:38.380
Resurrect, Sunavalon Daphne!

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:43.430
The Continuous Spell, 
Sunvine Shrine’s effect!

00:10:43.430 --> 00:10:48.890
I can Special Summon a Level 4 
or below Plant from my graveyard!

00:10:48.890 --> 00:10:52.360
Resurrect, Genius Loci!

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:56.980
Appear!  The future circuit 
that lights up our path!

00:10:56.980 --> 00:11:00.720
The summoning condition is one Plant!

00:11:02.590 --> 00:11:03.570
This is…

00:11:03.570 --> 00:11:06.550
Is this possible?

00:11:06.550 --> 00:11:08.290
Link Summon!

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:11.950
Link 1 Sunvine Thrasher!

00:11:12.750 --> 00:11:16.740
Spectre now has the Extra Monster Zones!

00:11:29.070 --> 00:11:31.310
He reversed the Extra Link!

00:11:35.310 --> 00:11:37.980
Thrasher’s effect activates!

00:11:37.980 --> 00:11:43.540
When linked to a Sunavalon, it gains 800 
ATK for every one of its Link Markers!

00:11:43.540 --> 00:11:45.620
Melias is Link 3!

00:11:45.620 --> 00:11:49.860
Thrasher gains 2400 ATK!

00:11:49.860 --> 00:11:56.670
I rewatched Revolver and Playmaker’s duel 
at the Tower of Hanoi countless times.

00:11:56.670 --> 00:11:59.440
That’s where I saw the Extra Link.

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:03.020
A field that epitomized Link Summoning!

00:12:03.020 --> 00:12:04.850
It was beautiful!

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:08.770
Is there any field more beautiful?

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:11.770
That sight was burned into my eyes!

00:12:11.770 --> 00:12:19.200
And now, I was able to create 
that field with my own hands!

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:27.910
Light Ignis, it's the only 
thing I'll thank you for.

00:12:29.370 --> 00:12:34.600
I activate Sunseed Shadow’s effect!

00:12:35.390 --> 00:12:39.010
I banish it from the graveyard to target

00:12:39.010 --> 00:12:43.540
a Link 2 or lower Plant Link Monster 
that’s currently Extra Linked!

00:12:43.540 --> 00:12:46.510
I target Daphne!

00:12:46.510 --> 00:12:57.460
I Special Summon a second copy of the target 
from my Extra Deck so that it'll be Extra Linked!

00:12:57.460 --> 00:13:02.270
I Special Summon a second Sunavalon Daphne!

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:10.750
This is what even I couldn’t 
accomplish: Extra Link Full Mode.

00:13:17.670 --> 00:13:21.410
Spectre finally surpassed Revolver!

00:13:21.410 --> 00:13:26.530
Appear again!  The future circuit 
that lights up our path!

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:30.730
The summoning conditions 
are at least two Plants!

00:13:30.730 --> 00:13:32.570
Link Summon!

00:13:32.570 --> 00:13:37.800
Appear, Link 3 Sunavalon Dryanome!

00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:48.050
You brought out your ace monster.

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:57.080
Sunavalon Dryanome can’t be attacked.

00:13:57.080 --> 00:14:03.800
And since I used a Sunavalon Link Monster to 
Link Summon it, it gains multiple effects!

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:05.190
I know.

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:09.420
Three times per turn, if you take damage...

00:14:09.420 --> 00:14:12.810
...you can Special Summon 
Sunvine Link Monsters

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:15.750
from your Extra Deck next 
to Sunavalon’s links...

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:19.100
...and regain LP equal 
to the damage you took.

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:20.640
That’s right.

00:14:20.640 --> 00:14:24.250
And if you attack a monster 
next to its link...

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:29.510
...I can negate your attack by moving it to 
a different location in the Main Monster Zone.

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:32.750
I activate Sunseed Twin’s 
effect from my graveyard!

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:38.960
When it's in the graveyard, I can banish 
it and a Link Monster on the field...

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:41.980
...to Special Summon 
Thrasher from my graveyard!

00:14:43.960 --> 00:14:46.130
Thrasher’s effect activates!

00:14:46.130 --> 00:14:47.800
It gains ATK!

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:53.140
Now Spectre’s field is perfect.

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:56.760
Wow!  You don’t see this often!

00:14:56.760 --> 00:14:58.890
This is a huge scoop!

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:05.120
You call yourself weak, 
but you're very flashy.

00:15:05.120 --> 00:15:07.070
You’re right.

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:13.590
Even I got a little too excited 
to create this beautiful field.

00:15:13.590 --> 00:15:19.330
I see.  Humans think this field is beautiful.

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:23.820
It’s sad that you don’t 
understand this beauty.

00:15:23.820 --> 00:15:29.320
Is what you're hiding linked 
to this lack of aesthetics?

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:33.890
You’re the one who’s arrogant.

00:15:33.890 --> 00:15:37.160
You think you know me?

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:39.630
Stop looking down on me!

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:43.800
I’ve never seen Lightning act like this.

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:49.030
How nice.  I've never seen 
you emotional before.

00:15:49.030 --> 00:15:51.790
It's like a fragile tower built on sand.

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:55.230
Your field is beautiful in that sense.

00:15:56.200 --> 00:15:58.610
You think you can destroy this field?

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:02.420
My turn!  I draw!

00:16:03.160 --> 00:16:06.380
Do you think I’m stupid?

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:12.660
You think I didn't know you'd 
try to steal my Judgment Arrows?

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:18.600
I'll unleash divine judgment 
on this arrogant human!

00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:21.590
The sword of light that slices the heavens!

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:24.830
I activate the spell card, Judgment Sword!

00:16:25.990 --> 00:16:33.540
When only you have Link Monsters in the 
Extra Monster Zone, I can banish one of them.

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:36.570
And I Special Summon an 
Armatos Legio from my

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:41.260
Extra Deck with the same Link 
Markers as the banished monster.

00:16:42.050 --> 00:16:48.540
Then I Special Summon the banished 
monster in your Main Monster Zone!

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:56.240
I banish your Sunavalon Dryanome!

00:17:03.180 --> 00:17:09.980
Your cherished mother tree is invincible 
against attacks, but not against effects.

00:17:09.980 --> 00:17:13.080
How dare you do that to my mother tree!

00:17:13.080 --> 00:17:17.180
But my field isn't broken yet!

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:22.170
I Special Summon Armatos 
Legio Tribunus Militum!

00:17:26.910 --> 00:17:32.840
And the banished Dryanome is Special 
Summoned in your Main Monster Zone!

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:38.950
Armatos Colosseum’s effect activates!

00:17:39.920 --> 00:17:43.540
I send Armatos Legio in my 
hand to the graveyard...

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:46.990
...to Special Summon Speculata, Gladius and

00:17:46.990 --> 00:17:50.980
Sica next to Tribunus Militum’s 
links in defense position!

00:17:52.860 --> 00:17:55.850
Appear!  The circuit that guides the light!

00:17:55.850 --> 00:18:00.340
The summoning conditions are 
at least three Armatos Legio!

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:07.080
Appear!  The commander that advances 
on the chaotic network battlefield!

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:08.810
Link Summon!

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:16.020
Link 4 Armatos Legio Magnus Dux!

00:18:17.840 --> 00:18:19.470
It’s huge!

00:18:19.470 --> 00:18:22.210
Lightning’s Link 4 monster!

00:18:22.210 --> 00:18:28.290
When it's on the field, for 
every co-linked monster...

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:34.690
...I can return cards on our fields or 
graveyards to the owners' hands once.

00:18:36.430 --> 00:18:38.280
I see.  With this…

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:42.400
Lightning will return 
Judgment Arrows to his hand.

00:18:42.400 --> 00:18:47.130
But you can’t target Judgment Arrows!

00:18:47.130 --> 00:18:55.210
My Sunvine Plunder's effect prevents you 
from targeting this card and the card it stole!

00:18:55.210 --> 00:18:57.390
Unless I do this!

00:18:57.390 --> 00:19:00.000
Tribunus Militum’s effect activates!

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:05.470
Once per turn, I target a Link 
Monster next to its link.

00:19:05.470 --> 00:19:11.720
Until the end of the turn, an effect on our 
fields is negated for every one of its Link Markers.

00:19:11.720 --> 00:19:15.420
I select Magnus Dux!

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:18.220
Magnus Dux has four Link Markers.

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:24.980
Shrine, Plunder, Cross Breed and 
Dryanome's effects are negated!

00:19:25.820 --> 00:19:27.230
How’s that?

00:19:27.230 --> 00:19:30.220
Now I can activate Magnus Dux’s effect.

00:19:30.220 --> 00:19:33.060
Magnus Dux’s effect activates!

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:40.140
Magnus Dux is co-linked with one monster.

00:19:40.140 --> 00:19:43.000
I return Judgment Arrows to the hand!

00:19:47.440 --> 00:19:50.430
I took back Judgment Arrows.

00:19:50.430 --> 00:19:55.440
And now, a chain of destruction 
starts on your field.

00:19:55.440 --> 00:20:02.360
Watch as I pulverize the 
artistic field you created!

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:12.070
When Judgment Arrows leaves the Spell & Trap 
Zone, all monsters next to its links are destroyed!

00:20:16.700 --> 00:20:18.730
My field!

00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:25.940
And when your Thrasher isn't next to a 
Sunavalon’s link, it’s destroyed!

00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:30.270
Spectre’s field…

00:20:30.270 --> 00:20:32.260
Is instantly…

00:20:35.240 --> 00:20:38.250
I activate a Link Spell.

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:42.040
Appear!  The three arrows 
that judge the world!

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:43.470
Judgment Arrows!

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:46.650
I'll destroy that one.

00:20:46.650 --> 00:20:51.400
Battle!  Magnus Dux attacks Dryanome!

00:20:52.620 --> 00:20:55.560
Judgment Arrows’s effect!

00:20:55.560 --> 00:21:00.250
Magnus Dux’s ATK are doubled.

00:21:18.280 --> 00:21:19.770
Spectre!

